      <h1>Refer a company</h1>
      <p class="lead">Know a company with years of operating history? The data buyer pays for a qualified introduction. You don't need to sell anything, understand AI, or convince anyone to hand over their systems.</p>
      <p><a class="btn" href="#refer-form">Make an introduction</a></p>
    </div>
